_printed_pages","html":"32"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"52"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e^A\">\\(W_e^A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_T\">\\(&lt;_T\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_e:\\mathcal O\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(V_e:\\mathcal O\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\">\\(\\mathcal O\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSequence}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSequence}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>；集合性质作用于序列时依以下关系或已有共同oracle接口解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_e(A)\\coloneqq \\operatorname{AsSet}(A)\\oplus W_e^A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_e(A)\\coloneqq \\operatorname{AsSet}(A)\\oplus W_e^A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NontrivialPseudoJump}(e)\\iff\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(A&lt;_TV_e(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NontrivialPseudoJump}(e)\\iff\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(A&lt;_TV_e(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>以算子的编号e为非平凡性谓词的参数，避免量化一个未编码的抽象计算过程。V_e(A)总是包含A作为可计算投影；非平凡性要求对每个oracle都严格上升。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：Definition 5.10.2 (Jockusch and Shore)。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1278f108eb178d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e\\in\\mathbb N$；$A\\in\\mathcal O$。$W_e^A$、$\\oplus$、$<_T$ 分别采用 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-turing-join]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。$V_